      <p style="color:#a9bcd0;font-size:17px;margin:0">Sharktech's documented cybersecurity scope covers eight defined services for Australian businesses.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="card"><div class="tag">01</div><h3>Security Health Check</h3><p>Assess accounts, administrator access, MFA, patching, backups and recovery against the Essential Eight.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><div class="tag">02</div><h3>Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing</h3><p>Authorised testing of websites, applications and networks with verified findings and remediation guidance.</p></article>
